          <change when="2023-10-24T11:00:14-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/james.cowey">Vote - Accept-Straight-to-Finalization - Yes, well picked up. [Μ]α̣ντινόην =&gt; [Μ(?)]α̣ντινόην as both Rea - "might be another documentary examples, i.e. restore Μ]αντινόην" and Cuvigny - "il faut probablement restituer Μ]αντινόην" are still equivocal.</change>
